        "id": "scene_b2_u08_1",
        "desc": "Thick white fog rolls over the Word Pond; the stepping stones ahead have vanished into the mist and only the nearest one is visible. Bun stretches her arms out blindly; Hedgie holds Bun's tail; Pip says a word backwards with a worried face; Beads peeks over a stone. A happy brown puppy barks at the fog, and a brown wooden log drifts by on the grey water. Hidden in the picture: the fog, the dog, the log. Grumble does NOT appear.",
