      {
        "id": "scene_b2_u08_3",
        "desc": "Deep in the fog a single warm dot of orange light glows: it is Grumble standing on a stepping stone holding his lantern high over his head, the glow making a bright circle in the mist. Behind him on the bank is his little camp: a green camp cot, and on a small fire a red cooking pot with steam rising, a big red dot painted on its lid. Bun points at the light; Hedgie and Pip look relieved; Beads threads p-o-t. Hidden in the picture: the pot, the steaming hot pot, the red dot on the lid, the cot.",
